{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>The hornet.</b> A species of flying insect. It would strike them in their eyes and inject venom into them and they would die. And the hornet did not cross the Jordan, and the Hivite and the Canaanite are the lands of Sihon and Og — therefore of all seven nations it lists only these here. And the Hivite — even though it is across the Jordan and beyond, our Sages taught in tractate Sotah (36a): it stood at the bank of the Jordan and splattered venom at them."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:12.873277351Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}